    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within your reach attacks one of your allies.</p><hr><p><strong>Family Beast</strong></p><p><strong>Anima Weapon </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.ciXP2jqSEXh9EXR1]{Anima Weapon: Vengeful Bite}</p><p><strong>Anima Morph </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.WUIJ9Hdlcc7hwZGE]{Anima Morph: Vengeful Bite}</p><p><strong>Anima Ability</strong> @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.xDqSyXCnv7irpJTw]{Anima Ability: Vengeful Bite}</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You retaliate against an enemy trying to attack a member of your pack. You make an Anima Strike against the triggering creature.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Heightened (5th) </strong>When you successfully Strike a creature with this spell, you can then attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.ge56Lu1xXVFYUnLP]{Trip} them.</p>"
